A||||1||Klown||Supertrapp Mufflers||||5||
Z||000000||Klown||04-23-2000||06:14 AM||||Does anyone have any experience with supertrapp mufflers?  I was thinking of replacing my Ocelot exhaust with a "Y-pipe" and having a supertrapp muffler at each exhaust tip but I was concerned about the amount of noise the system would put out.  Would this setup be louder than the Ocelot setup and are Supertrapps any quieter than your average glasspack? I was hoping to keep the noise level about the same as my current setup.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Cooter||04-23-2000||12:58 PM||||I pulled a supertrap off a wrecked car I was working on and used it on my generator (8hp brigg's) The supertrap with 10 disks had so much back pressure that after a few seconds the engine would die. I pulled the disks off and placed a small washer to add space between them. Now the engine runs and isnt near as annoying as a standard muffler.||||reg||1
